      ],
      "prose": "Let $\\mathbf{a} = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$ and $\\mathbf{b} = \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 3 \\end{pmatrix}$.",
      "question": "What is the angle between them, to one decimal place?",
      "widget": {
